hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"966","Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi told us, Abd al-Rahman bin Mahdi told us, Qurrah told us, on the authority of Abu al-Zubayr, Abu Tufayl told us, Muadh bin Jabal narrated to us, saying: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, gathered together on a journey that he traveled, and that was in the Battle of Tabuk, so he gathered the Dhuhr And the afternoon, and between the sunset and the evening.” He said: I said: What motivated him to do that? He said: He wanted not to embarrass his nation. Yaqoub Al-Dawraqi told us, Abd al-Rahman told us, Qurrah told us, on the authority of Abu al-Zubayr, on the authority of Sa`id bin Jubayr, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, in a similar way."
"967","I am Abu Tahir, we are Abu Bakr, we are Ya’qub al-Dawrqi, we are Abd al-Rahman, we are Qurra, on the authority of Abu al-Zubayr, on the authority of Sa’id bin Jubayr, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, similarly"
